### MindEvidence Lab API: example requests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client.
### The same calls as curl commands are in backend/README.md.
###
### Most endpoints require Google sign-in (session cookie). Without it they answer
### 401 authentication_required, which is itself a useful check. To call them signed in,
### sign in via the browser, then copy the `me_session` cookie value into @session below
### and the csrf_token from GET /api/auth/session into @csrf. Never commit those values.

@base = http://localhost:8000
@session = paste-me_session-cookie-here
@csrf = paste-csrf_token-here

### Sign-in state (public; authenticated:false without a cookie)
GET {{base}}/api/auth/session
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### Unauthenticated → 401 authentication_required
GET {{base}}/api/patients

### Health (200 ok, or 503 with status "degraded" if PostgreSQL is down)
GET {{base}}/api/health

### List patients (paginated)
GET {{base}}/api/patients?limit=5&offset=0
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### Filter by category and search text
GET {{base}}/api/patients?category=alcohol&q=withdrawal
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### One patient (full synthetic record)
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P-004
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### Chronological history (paginated)
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P-004/history?limit=50
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### Malformed id → 422 validation_error
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P-1
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### Unknown id → 404 patient_not_found
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P-999
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### Paper catalogue
GET {{base}}/api/papers
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### Create a session (needs cookie + CSRF token)
POST {{base}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: me_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"patient_id": "P-004", "title": "Maintenance vs detox", "mode": "rag"}

### Unknown patient in body → 422 unknown_patient
POST {{base}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: me_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"patient_id": "P-099"}

### List my sessions
GET {{base}}/api/sessions?limit=20
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### Messages in a session (replace the id; empty until Batch 07 writes answers)
GET {{base}}/api/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages
Cookie: me_session={{session}}

### Sign out (revokes the session server-side)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Cookie: me_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### Correlate with your own request id
GET {{base}}/api/health
X-Request-ID: my-trace-001
